.Sh HISTORY
Relocation handling has been a core feature of
.Nm libelfobj
since its initial implementation.
.Sh BUGS
.Bl -bullet
.It
Relaxation optimization is not implemented.
.It
There is no API to iterate relocations by index.
.It
The maximum number of backends (16) is fixed at compile time.
.El
